            "detailed_description": "Toro, is the first bullfighting simulator game that will challenge your skills, reflexes and fast reactions while facing 1100lbs bulls.<br />\r\nComplete the Single Player mode and improve your bullfighting skills in several plazas around the world, or try the mini-games putting yourself in the bull's skin.<br />\r\nToro offers the possibility to get in front of the most dangerous bulls and complete a stylish performance with the wide variety of passes that are available for each round.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nCombine different passes to get the applause of the audience while in order to reach the highest score.",
